Package: SuSoSimulate
Type: Package
Title: Mock Data and Paradata Generator for Survey Solutions Questionnaires
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Emanuele", "Clemente", email = "emanueleclemente91@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads a Survey Solutions questionnaire (Designer document.json,
    Designer or Headquarters export archive, or - experimentally - the PDF
    printout), translates its C# enabling conditions, validations, filters and
    calculated variables, and generates fully routed synthetic interviews whose
    branch coverage is checked and repaired. Writes Stata files with the same
    multi-file relational layout, variable naming, labels and missing-value
    conventions as a Survey Solutions export, plus consistent paradata and
    system files.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: jsonlite, haven, stats, tools, utils
Suggests: pdftools, readxl, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
URL: https://github.com/emawbgit/SuSoSimulate
BugReports: https://github.com/emawbgit/SuSoSimulate/issues
